# DESK14 run A -- the success path: Options -> "Read .INF file...", pick
# C:\DESKT14.INF out of the selector, OK.  DESKT14.INF differs from the
# built-in defaults in two places that show in the picture:
#   #Q ... 72 40  -> the >2-plane desktop background becomes solid red (IP_SOLID
#                    + VDI colour 2) instead of pattern 4 / green
#   #M 00 00 / #T 02 00 / #O 04 00 -> all three desktop icons in the top row
# Its first two bytes are "#R", so it passes the EmuTOS signature check
# (deskapp.c:1523-1525).
#
#   Options title centre (196, 8); "Read .INF file..." = entry 10 -> (200, 187).
#   Selector geometry from the probe run (method/desk14_patch.py dump):
#     FSOK       abs (184,393) 72x16 -> centre (220, 401)
#     FSCANCEL   abs (291,393) 72x16 -> centre (327, 401)
#     F7NAME     abs (200,310) 120x16 -> centre (260, 318)  = DESKT14.INF
#     (six folders sort first, then the files alphabetically)
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 196 8
2200 mark B_OPTIONS
2500 move 200 187
2700 down
2703 up
2900 move 600 240
4000 mark C_FSEL
4300 move 260 318
4500 down
4503 up
4700 move 600 240
5300 mark D_PICKED
5600 move 220 401
5800 down
5803 up
6000 move 600 240
7200 mark E_APPLIED
